(18. attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha   (re-attach to origin))
(Now origin has task profile linked again (goal satisfied). Origin remains prepared etc.)
(Now we need to assemble transport leg.)
(But we must ensure that origin_availability_locked and confirmed still true after we detached and re-attached profile? Those are unaffected by attach/detach task profile. So still true.)
