(Destination_node_ready and destination_node_occupied remain true.)
(Now we need transport_leg_available transport_leg_alpha (still true, we haven't used it). Good.)
(Now we can assemble transport leg:)
(19. assemble_transport_leg origin_availability_alpha destination_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha destination_node_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Preconditions: need origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha true (yes), destination_availability_locked destination_availability_alpha true (yes), origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha true, destination_availability_node_linked destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha true, origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha true, destination_node_ready destination_node_alpha true, origin_availability_confirmed origin_availability_alpha true, destination_availability_confirmed destination_availability_alpha true, transport_leg_available transport_leg_alpha true.)
