(Effect: transport_leg_assembled true, transport_leg_origin_linked origin_node_alpha true, transport_leg_destination_linked destination_node_alpha true, transport_leg_available false.)
(Now we have all goal predicates.)
(Let's verify each goal:)
(- candidate_prepared destination_availability_alpha: true (step 12))
(- candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha: true (step 3))
(- candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha: true (step 18))
(- candidate_vehicle_linked destination_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_beta: true (step 10))
